flowchart LR
    USER[User]
    TEAM[Delivery Team]

    subgraph App[Auth-First Yugastore]
        UI[React UI]
        GW[API Gateway]
        AUTH[Login Service]
        PROD[Products Service]
        CHECK[Checkout Service]
        CART[Cart Service]
    end

    subgraph Data[Persistence]
        YSQL[(YSQL: users, cart)]
        YCQL[(YCQL: products, checkout)]
    end

    subgraph Planning[Repo-Local Planning]
        PRD[Auth-First PRD]
        AUTHSPEC[OpenSpec: merchant-auth-foundation]
        NEXT[Downstream changes blocked until auth completes]
    end

    USER --> UI
    UI --> GW
    GW --> AUTH
    GW --> PROD
    GW --> CHECK
    GW --> CART

    AUTH --> YSQL
    CART --> YSQL
    PROD --> YCQL
    CHECK --> YCQL

    AUTH -. validates credentials, creates auth state .-> GW
    GW -. resolves current authenticated user .-> CART
    GW -. resolves current authenticated user .-> CHECK

    TEAM --> PRD
    PRD --> AUTHSPEC
    AUTHSPEC --> NEXT